{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56407","headline":"宿南岩寺感兴 · 齐顗","name":"宿南岩寺感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南岩寺，本沧海，任子钓台今尚在。\n见说垂钓於此中，犗牛钓饵庄书载。\n沧海竭，任子殁，波涛打处爲岩窟。\n不知任子何所之，唯见钓台空㟮屼。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷九。\n）（〖1〗《嘉泰会稽志》卷十一云：新昌县「齐公井，在县南五里南明山东麓，俗云齐相井。\n唐齐顗所居山中有十五题，井其一也。\n」原注：「案齐顗不爲相，俗传误也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐顗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}